{"data":[{"id":1993,"slug":"mookhyang-the-origin","title":"Mookhyang The Origin","alt_titles":["墨剑留香前传","طریقت موک هیانگ","墨香 THE ORIGIN","มุกฮยาง ดิ ออริจิน","묵향 디 오리진"],"description":"In a world with bloody and vast battlefields where several forces fought for supremacy; a young boy only known as number 2044, was kidnapped and trained to be an assassin by the enemy since he was a child. After much intensive training and struggling through life-threatening situations, he gained the name “Mukhyang”. But Mukhyang was never satisfied, he had an unfulfilled thirst for something, and that was the path of the sword! As Mukhyang was dissatisfied with his life as an assassin, he met his mentor 'Yu Baek of the Hwan Sa Sword' and his life changed forever. Will he be able to reach the pinnacle of martial arts?!\r\n\r\nFighting with geniuses as he climbs his way to the top!","cover":"https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/mookhyang-the-origin.1f831b.webp","status":"completed","type":"manhwa","author":"Jeon Dongjo","artist":"Redice Studio","popularity_rank":335,"bookmark_count":1735,"rating":8.9375,"chapter_count":48,"last_chapter_at":"2022-01-01T00:00:00Z","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T08:01:51.919508Z","public_url":"/comics/mookhyang-the-origin-7ba78ec7","source_url":"/s/1993","genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action","slug":"action"},{"id":34,"name":"Murim","slug":"murim"},{"id":55,"name":"Shounen","slug":"shounen"}],"latest_chapters":[{"id":141508,"series_id":0,"number":47,"slug":"bae380a7-f8fb-497d-83ac-e4ab409b1d5c","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2021-08-15T21:19:26Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":141506,"series_id":0,"number":46,"slug":"1fa416b5-0802-4141-8fbe-61d8d102f628","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2021-08-06T18:55:09Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":141505,"series_id":0,"number":45,"slug":"8b2b4b91-a6b1-4c70-8260-c5ba39e80be8","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2021-08-02T18:30:50Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}]},{"id":1939,"slug":"i-shall-live-as-a-prince","title":"I Shall Live As a Prince","alt_titles":["大君として生きよ","My Royal Awakening","대군으로 살어리랏다","Жизнь в теле принца"],"description":"Lee Hyun Ho, an ordinary man who was looking for a job in Korea, has been reincarnated into a prince from the Joseon dynasty.\r\n\r\nBut unfortunately, he was reincarnated into Grand Prince Jinseong, the younger brother of the tyrant Yeonsangun!\r\n\r\nAlthough he graduated from a decent school, Hyun ho struggled to find a job.\r\n\r\nOne day, he went to sleep after spending his day living the ordinary life of a poor Korean, and when he opened his eyes, he found himself as Grand Prince Jinseong from the 15th century.\r\n\r\nSince he was now a rich prince, his plan was to live the high life but…\r\n\r\nHe finds out that his brother is Yeonsangun, the king of Joseon, infamous for being a crazy tyrant!\r\n\r\nAnd thus marks the start of the ordinary job seeker, Grand Prince Jinseong's (Lee Hyun Ho) plan of making the tyrant Yeonsangun into a great king and to protect his own wife.\r\n\r\nThe unpredictable ‘Yeonsangun mental care project’! ‘Alright~~ Let’s change history!’","cover":"https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/i-shall-live-as-a-prince.e666a1.webp","status":"completed","type":"manhwa","author":"Dopamine","artist":"Kim Taehyung","popularity_rank":286,"bookmark_count":2311,"rating":9.193103448275862,"chapter_count":88,"last_chapter_at":"2022-06-18T11:10:36Z","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:01:50.982684Z","public_url":"/comics/i-shall-live-as-a-prince-7ba78ec7","source_url":"/s/1939","genres":[{"id":16,"name":"Fantasy","slug":"fantasy"},{"id":24,"name":"Isekai","slug":"isekai"}],"latest_chapters":[{"id":142823,"series_id":0,"number":88,"slug":"ec3029cc-4818-4adb-89db-500095a0875b","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2022-06-18T11:10:36Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":142821,"series_id":0,"number":87,"slug":"a889d241-023e-45b9-8cbf-f6e3043ac4b6","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2022-06-07T02:55:12Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":142820,"series_id":0,"number":86,"slug":"817cf0ca-4150-4744-8f6c-7d22bd4394c0","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2022-05-31T12:05:34Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}]},{"id":1929,"slug":"return-of-the-8th-class-magician","title":"Return of the 8th Class Magician","alt_titles":["8-Class Mabeopsaui Hoegwi","The Return of the 8th Class Magician","การกลับมาของจอมเวทระดับ 8","Повернення мага 8-го класу","8級魔法師再臨","8. Sınıf Büyücünün Dönüşü","回归的8阶魔法师","Регрессия мага 8-го класса","8클래스 마법사의 회귀","Le Retour du magicien de classe 8","8クラス魔法使いのやり直し","The Return of the 8th Class Mage","Return of The 8th Class Mage"],"description":"It's been many years since I've bloodied my hands for the United Empire and its emperor, Ragnar. I wanted to return to my hometown and live a quiet life as if to repent for my sins.\r\n\r\nHowever,\r\n\r\n\"You are a great 8th class magician who is able to overthrow me and the empire at any time\"\r\n\r\n\"How could I let a monster like you stay alive?\"\r\n\r\nAfter being betrayed on the verge of death by Ragnar, who was my friend as well as my Emperor, He stabbed my heart with a dagger that had time magic applied to it.\r\n\r\n\"The redemption I want is to put everything back to its place.\"\r\n\r\n ","cover":"https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/return-of-the-8th-class-magician.3c03f3.webp","status":"completed","type":"manhwa","author":"Ryu Song","artist":"Carrotoon","popularity_rank":194,"bookmark_count":11495,"rating":9.253703703703703,"chapter_count":81,"last_chapter_at":"2023-03-24T02:07:16Z","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:01:42.447559Z","public_url":"/comics/return-of-the-8th-class-magician-7ba78ec7","source_url":"/s/1929","genres":[{"id":16,"name":"Fantasy","slug":"fantasy"},{"id":20,"name":"Genius MC","slug":"genius-mc"},{"id":44,"name":"Reincarnation","slug":"reincarnation"},{"id":48,"name":"Revenge","slug":"revenge"},{"id":55,"name":"Shounen","slug":"shounen"}],"latest_chapters":[{"id":157286,"series_id":0,"number":81,"title":"{END}","slug":"41a0bfe9-4576-4ebf-aeb5-2359707dd287","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2022-12-25T21:53:07Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":157284,"series_id":0,"number":80,"slug":"e11a3772-193e-4a7b-a91b-1242338b32a2","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2022-12-18T14:35:19Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":157285,"series_id":0,"number":79,"slug":"642e7c3a-4f22-420b-992a-f679364e9433","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2022-12-12T15:23:29Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}]},{"id":1935,"slug":"i-grow-stronger-by-eating","title":"I Grow Stronger By Eating!","alt_titles":["먹을수록 강해짐","با خوردن قویتر میشم","最强饭桶","Пожирая, крепнет","Я становлюсь сильнее, пожирая всё на своем пути","Gewaltiger Hunger","Appétit féroce","I Get Stronger the More I Eat"],"description":"Everyone has a talent of their own.\r\n\r\nAnd the talent I have is ‘eating’.\r\n\r\nA talent that shines much brighter in this world where countless powerful organisms dwell.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nFeast Devour.\r\n\r\nConsume the blood and flesh of the strong and make that yours.\r\n\r\nEven if it’s a dragon, a demon king, or a god!\r\n\r\n ","cover":"https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/i-grow-stronger-by-eating.3eafec.webp","status":"completed","type":"manhwa","author":"Frost Mourne","artist":"MStoryHub","popularity_rank":243,"bookmark_count":6014,"rating":8.735099337748345,"chapter_count":100,"last_chapter_at":"2023-07-10T00:06:22Z","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:01:50.982684Z","public_url":"/comics/i-grow-stronger-by-eating-7ba78ec7","source_url":"/s/1935","genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action","slug":"action"},{"id":4,"name":"Adventure","slug":"adventure"},{"id":16,"name":"Fantasy","slug":"fantasy"},{"id":24,"name":"Isekai","slug":"isekai"},{"id":55,"name":"Shounen","slug":"shounen"}],"latest_chapters":[{"id":143349,"series_id":0,"number":100,"title":"The End","slug":"03333bab-a226-4f68-8280-0376533efc69","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2023-07-10T00:06:22Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":143346,"series_id":0,"number":99,"slug":"3628a37e-4cb8-489a-9686-7696d6706e44","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2023-07-10T00:06:19Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":143474,"series_id":0,"number":98,"slug":"f027ca5b-2856-4ea8-b5ef-ee875f79d2bb","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2023-06-10T21:00:18Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}]},{"id":1916,"slug":"heavenly-demon-instructor","title":"Heavenly Demon Instructor","alt_titles":["Jinma Gyouten-ki","重生之我在魔教耍长枪","Chronicles of the Heavenly Demon","Sinma Gyeongcheongi","The Chronicles of Heavenly Demon","신마경천기","Heavenly Demon Reborn!","Chronicles of Heavenly Demon","Biên Niên Sử Của Thiên Quỷ","Divine Astonishment","神魔驚天記","Shin Makyou Tenki"],"description":"\"Master, what's the next lesson?!!!\"\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nA disaster that struck the earth, [Portal Impact], caused Park Hyunsoo, the MC, to lose his parents before his eyes.\r\nThe only family member he has left is his younger sibling who is unconscious.\r\nIn order to protect his younger sibling, he did his best but as a powerless support, he would always be on the other side of contempt...\r\nAnd that's when a helper, Chungyeong, appeared!\r\nChungyeong, a murim martial master that has travelled through time to come here from the Murim to teach Hyunsoo martial arts...\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\"Hey, disciple...\"\r\n\"Yes, Master.\"\r\n\r\n ","cover":"https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/heavenly-demon-instructor.88073a.webp","status":"completed","type":"manhwa","author":"Ilhwang","artist":"Seoul Media Comics","popularity_rank":255,"bookmark_count":5535,"rating":8.439024390243903,"chapter_count":105,"last_chapter_at":"2023-07-15T22:09:52Z","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:01:50.982684Z","public_url":"/comics/heavenly-demon-instructor-7ba78ec7","source_url":"/s/1916","genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action","slug":"action"},{"id":4,"name":"Adventure","slug":"adventure"},{"id":14,"name":"Dungeons","slug":"dungeons"},{"id":16,"name":"Fantasy","slug":"fantasy"},{"id":34,"name":"Murim","slug":"murim"},{"id":55,"name":"Shounen","slug":"shounen"},{"id":63,"name":"System","slug":"system"}],"latest_chapters":[{"id":146754,"series_id":0,"number":105,"title":"The End -","slug":"fc1e5853-641e-456d-832d-dcd5b8dca619","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2023-07-15T22:09:52Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":146762,"series_id":0,"number":104,"slug":"66e860e8-509c-4628-ba34-1f00f9db453a","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2023-07-15T22:09:46Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":146753,"series_id":0,"number":103,"slug":"2a106650-9699-4013-8344-a2d38bfae3c7","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2023-07-15T22:09:43Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}]},{"id":2104,"slug":"never-die-extra","title":"Never Die Extra","alt_titles":["죽지 않는 엑스트라","Neverdie Extra","死なないエキストラ"],"description":"In the smash hit game, [Demon War 3], there are 'extras' that die every day in all sorts of ways. But despite not contributing the slightest bit to the game, an extra named Evan D. Shelden has a death scene with exclusive computer graphics that stole the love of the production team! Damn it, isn't that the name I received when I was reincarnated into this game world? I, someone who isn't the main character and an extra who has too many deaths to count, must survive at all costs!\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n ","cover":"https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/never-die-extra.004015.webp","status":"completed","type":"manhwa","author":"Eldo","artist":"Studio Zilpung","popularity_rank":341,"bookmark_count":1751,"rating":7.36734693877551,"chapter_count":60,"last_chapter_at":"2023-07-20T16:58:25Z","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T07:01:51.505324Z","public_url":"/comics/never-die-extra-7ba78ec7","source_url":"/s/2104","genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action","slug":"action"},{"id":4,"name":"Adventure","slug":"adventure"},{"id":7,"name":"Comedy","slug":"comedy"},{"id":16,"name":"Fantasy","slug":"fantasy"},{"id":35,"name":"Mystery","slug":"mystery"}],"latest_chapters":[{"id":150382,"series_id":0,"number":60,"title":"The End -","slug":"a1e65ba5-a800-4155-93bd-8b5dfefb4026","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2023-07-20T16:58:25Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":150381,"series_id":0,"number":59,"slug":"b2f801a2-885a-42d0-83eb-2d00f23b1a85","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2023-07-13T15:22:06Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":150377,"series_id":0,"number":58,"slug":"26184c97-1c38-4ccf-bf7a-1399ab12fa6c","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2023-07-06T22:01:39Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}]},{"id":2046,"slug":"of-all-things-i-became-a-crow","title":"Of All Things, I Became a Crow","alt_titles":["偏偏變成了烏鴉","Так ли плохо быть вороной","کَوِّی کا شَہزادَہ","Я неизбежно стала вороной","Я стала вороной","Lady Corneille","Otome Oyununda Bir Karga Oldum!","I Have Become a Crow","De todas as coisas, eu virei um corvo","よりによってカラスになってしまった","Die Krähe und der Prinz","I Have Turned Into a Crow of All Things","از این همه چیز، من تبدیل به یک کلاغ شدم","ทำไมฉันต้องกลายเป็นอีกา","I Became a Crow"],"description":"\u003cp\u003eAfter dying in an accident, she was reincarnated in an otome game.…As a Crow! I can’t believe that I am a crow! Not an extra character, but a crow! When I was looking for a person around me…The first person who appeared was the Crown Prince.\n“How could you be so lovely, Reinel?” “Cawk Cawk, Cawk! (Take me with you and raise me!)”The Crown Prince, Kamut, gave me a name and treated me with love. I’m just a crow anyway, there’d be no problem if I liked him or if my heart fluttered for him.There was no problem until… “Hello, Reinel?” “What is happening to me all of a sudden?”\u003c/p\u003e","cover":"https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/of-all-things-i-became-a-crow.2e439b.webp","status":"completed","type":"manhwa","author":"Silverstar","artist":"Supercomix Studio","popularity_rank":221,"bookmark_count":7531,"rating":9.585365853658537,"chapter_count":107,"last_chapter_at":"2023-11-11T03:31:13Z","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T06:01:51.959745Z","public_url":"/comics/of-all-things-i-became-a-crow-7ba78ec7","source_url":"/s/2046","genres":[{"id":16,"name":"Fantasy","slug":"fantasy"},{"id":49,"name":"Romance","slug":"romance"},{"id":54,"name":"Shoujo","slug":"shoujo"}],"latest_chapters":[{"id":147918,"series_id":0,"number":107,"slug":"fa903451-df0e-4bbe-b541-195cd4c5e80c","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2023-11-11T03:31:13Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":147915,"series_id":0,"number":106,"slug":"7d00ca2b-ba1d-49f6-844b-4fecf6976e5b","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2023-11-01T16:39:51Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":147911,"series_id":0,"number":105,"slug":"ba95ec99-68ad-4860-a7a0-1151a01b561f","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2023-10-28T16:41:51Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}]},{"id":1955,"slug":"solo-leveling","title":"Solo Leveling","alt_titles":["Tek başına seviye atlama","Ore dake Level Up na Ken","俺だけレベルアップな件","Solo adtritio","Upando sozinho","სოლო ლეველინგი","나 혼자만 레벨업","केवल मैं स्तर बढ़ाता हूं","Singur îmi ridic nivelul","Grinding Sendiri","俺だけレベルアップな件　～外伝～","تکرو","Тільки я візьму новий рівень","Na Honjaman Level Up","나혼렙","Only I Level Up","Leveling Up Alone","Na Honjaman Rebeleop","SL","Solo Leveling: Arise","Thăng Cấp Một Mình","Solo Leveling: Seulement moi je monte de niveau","Solo Leveling: El Nivel Mismo Subo","Solo Leveling: O Único que Sobe de Nível","Level Up Khon Diao","我独自升级","我獨自升級","Поднятие уровня в одиночку","سولو ليفلينج","เลเวลอัปคนเดียว"],"description":"\u003cp\u003e10 years ago, after “the Gate” that connected the real world with the monster world opened, some of the ordinary, everyday people received the power to hunt monsters within the Gate. They are known as \"Hunters\". However, not all Hunters are powerful. My name is Sung Jin-Woo, an E-rank Hunter. I'm someone who has to risk his life in the lowliest of dungeons, the \"World's Weakest\". Having no skills whatsoever to display, I barely earned the required money by fighting in low-leveled dungeons… at least until I found a hidden dungeon with the hardest difficulty within the D-rank dungeons! In the end, as I was accepting death, I suddenly received a strange power, a quest log that only I could see, a secret to leveling up that only I know about! If I trained in accordance with my quests and hunted monsters, my level would rise. Changing from the weakest  Hunter to the strongest S-rank Hunter!  \u003c/p\u003e","cover":"https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/solo-leveling.c27830.webp","banner":"https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/banners/solo-leveling.b0f7b9.webp","status":"completed","type":"manhwa","author":"추공 (Chugong)","artist":"REDICE STUDIO","popularity_rank":52,"bookmark_count":48268,"rating":9.749466382070437,"chapter_count":201,"last_chapter_at":"2024-07-13T02:15:04Z","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:01:42.447559Z","public_url":"/comics/solo-leveling-7ba78ec7","source_url":"/s/1955","genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action","slug":"action"},{"id":4,"name":"Adventure","slug":"adventure"},{"id":16,"name":"Fantasy","slug":"fantasy"},{"id":55,"name":"Shounen","slug":"shounen"}],"latest_chapters":[{"id":142312,"series_id":0,"number":200,"title":"Side Story 21 { THE END }","slug":"e85021f4-d477-4bc9-b2da-29b56e031f6b","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2024-07-13T02:15:04Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":142469,"series_id":0,"number":199,"title":"Side Story 20","slug":"3e0bb11b-de52-42b3-85f3-f5e18e36a35f","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2023-05-24T13:56:37Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":142314,"series_id":0,"number":198,"title":"Side Story 19","slug":"2e2ee4ce-b82d-411f-9b22-0cf267b304a9","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2023-05-17T13:29:02Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}]},{"id":1994,"slug":"ill-be-taking-a-break-for-personal-reasons","title":"I’ll Be Taking A Break For Personal Reasons","alt_titles":["สัปดาห์นี้งดอัปตอนใหม่","为了拯救世界暂时停更","일신상의 이유로 잠시 휴재합니다","Eu Tirei Férias Por Motivos Pessoais","On Hiatus: God's Personal Reasons","為了拯救世界暫停連載","I'm Taking a Break For Personal Reasons","El creador está en hiatus","Temporarily Closed for Work Reasons","神様になったのでしばらく休載します","The Creator Is on Hiatus"],"description":"\u003cstrong\u003e[Note: This is the manhwa's title, we are not taking an actual break.]\u003c/strong\u003eI'm a third-rate webnovel author named Yoo Ilshin. My name might be \"Only God\" in Korean, but don't start praying to me. I'm not actually a god, it's just a name.While only hunters are treated well in this world, it doesn't actually mean they're all equal. Once your rank is determined, your life will change completely.One day, I finally achieve the awakening I've been desperately wishing for.But my awakened ability is a bit strange...In this tiny otherworld I'm connected to via a smartphone, the weak and worthless ants worship me as god?A nobody like me has to save the world?\nThis can't be right! ","cover":"https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/ill-be-taking-a-break-for-personal-reasons.2df5d4.webp","status":"completed","type":"manhwa","author":"Canine","artist":"Rok Media","popularity_rank":238,"bookmark_count":8134,"rating":8.062857142857142,"chapter_count":121,"last_chapter_at":"2024-09-06T09:40:16Z","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:01:50.982684Z","public_url":"/comics/ill-be-taking-a-break-for-personal-reasons-7ba78ec7","source_url":"/s/1994","genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action","slug":"action"},{"id":4,"name":"Adventure","slug":"adventure"},{"id":16,"name":"Fantasy","slug":"fantasy"},{"id":18,"name":"Game","slug":"game"}],"latest_chapters":[{"id":158512,"series_id":0,"number":120,"title":"{Series END}","slug":"a99ac0d0-8d32-4881-901e-6bdb2adba261","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2024-09-06T09:40:16Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":158495,"series_id":0,"number":119,"slug":"b4ee2cb6-d953-4cb6-b455-de4b3bccd10a","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2024-09-04T23:22:37Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":158346,"series_id":0,"number":118,"slug":"101b0fd0-ac23-486e-abeb-c21eeffaba50","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":fals